      en: ["Elephants were successfully reintroduced in 2015.", "The park is now home to a growing population.", "They prefer the northern savannas and the lake areas.", "Their migrations contribute to seed dispersal.", "An important part of the 'Big Five' in Akagera National Park.", "Sightings are most likely in the early morning.", "Protection measures include monitoring with GPS collars."]
